post_upgrade() {
  cat <<'EOF'

NOTE: Aleph One has been patched to follow the XDG Base Directory
Specification.

Existing installations using ~/.alephone should migrate that directory
to the new location:

    ~/.local/share/alephone

or, when XDG_DATA_HOME is set:

    $XDG_DATA_HOME/alephone

You can migrate it with:

    mv ~/.alephone "${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/alephone"

The patched version no longer uses ~/.alephone.

EOF
}
